B.bsi=new A.kO("\u25b6\ufe0f","PECSglobal channel","YouTube","https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5OIn7c4hRfVR9E2qBDoNCQ","official demonstrations of each phase")
B.bsh=new A.kO("\ud83e\udde9","PECS Level 1 \u2014 what the training covers","Pyramid","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Dj6l4UJ0PCw","the six phases, explained in one sitting")
