B.aQ=new A.a0m(0,"idiom")
B.acc=new A.bu("Break a leg","Good luck with your performance, test or interview.","Theatre tradition: wishing someone luck by saying the opposite. Nobody wants your leg broken.","Thank you \u2014 that helps!",B.aQ)
B.acd=new A.bu("Kick the bucket","To die. It is a very informal, jokey way of saying someone died.","People usually say it about a character in a story, or half-joking about themselves. It is not a threat, and it is not about a real bucket. If someone says it about their own health, take the feeling seriously.","That sounds heavy to hear. Do you want to talk about it?",B.aQ)
B.acM=new A.bu("Play it by ear","Decide the next step later, as things happen, without a fixed plan.","Calm for some people, stressful for others. It is fine to ask for at least a start and end time.","Could we agree on a start time so I can prepare?",B.aQ)
B.acO=new A.bu("Whenever you get a chance / No rush / When you get a minute","Please do this today or within the next day, after anything urgent.","Still a real request, not optional \u2014 just lower priority than an emergency.","Got it, I will have this ready by tomorrow afternoon.",B.aQ)
B.acC=new A.bu("Would you like to / Do you mind / Could you maybe","Please do this now. It is phrased as a question only to sound polite.",'A question form does not make it optional. If you are not sure, it is fine to ask "is this a request?"',"Yes, I can do that. I will start now.",B.aQ)
B.acs=new A.bu("We should catch up sometime","I feel friendly toward you, even with no date planned.","Often a warm goodbye rather than a real invitation, unless they name a day.","I would like that \u2014 message me when you have a free afternoon.",B.aQ)
B.aci=new A.bu("Bite the bullet","Do the difficult or uncomfortable thing that cannot be avoided.","Used when starting something you have been putting off.","I am going to take it one small step at a time.",B.aQ)
B.acf=new A.bu("Hit the sack / Hit the hay","Go to bed and sleep.","A casual way of saying goodnight.","Goodnight, sleep well.",B.aQ)
B.ac4=new A.bu("Spill the beans / Spill the tea","Share the news, the secret or the story.","Informal curiosity, usually friendly. You can share only what you want.","I can tell you some of it \u2014 here is what happened.",B.aQ)
B.acp=new A.bu("Under the weather","Feeling slightly ill, tired or low.","Nothing to do with rain or weather.","I hope you feel better soon. Rest if you can.",B.aQ)
B.acG=new A.bu("Ball is in your court / Your call","It is your turn to decide or reply before anything else happens.","They are waiting for you. Taking your time is allowed.","Thanks \u2014 I will think about it and let you know my choice.",B.aQ)
B.acP=new A.bu("Walk on eggshells","Being very careful about what you say so someone does not get upset.","Describes tense communication. Direct, kind words usually help.","Please speak directly with me \u2014 clear words help me most.",B.aQ)
B.acX=new A.bu("Let us table this / Put a pin in it / Circle back","Pause this topic now and come back to it later.","Common in meetings when time runs out. It is not a rejection.","Sounds good \u2014 shall we put a time on it for tomorrow?",B.aQ)
B.acu=new A.bu("Piece of cake / Easy peasy","This is very easy.","Encouragement. What is easy for them may still be hard for you \u2014 that is fine.","Good to know. I may still need a bit of help with it.",B.aQ)
B.acg=new A.bu("It is not rocket science","This is simple; you should be able to do it.","Can sound impatient or critical. The task may simply be new to you.","I am still learning it. Please show me once more.",B.aQ)
B.acx=new A.bu("Pull yourself together","Stop showing strong feelings and behave calmly.","Often said when someone else is uncomfortable with your feelings. You are allowed to need time.","I need a moment to settle. I will come back when I can.",B.aQ)
B.acm=new A.bu("Give me a second / Hold your horses","Wait \u2014 do not rush me.","They need a moment. It is not a refusal.","Okay, take your time. I will wait here.",B.aQ)
B.aco=new A.bu("Read between the lines","The real message is not in the words; guess the hidden part.","Haven will not guess for you. If guessing goes wrong often, asking directly is fair.","I want to understand properly \u2014 can you say the main point directly?",B.aQ)
B.acJ=new A.bu("Costs an arm and a leg","Very expensive.","Nothing to do with body parts.","That is a lot. Is there a cheaper option?",B.aQ)
B.ack=new A.bu("Let the cat out of the bag","Tell a secret by accident.","Usually said lightly about a surprise being spoiled.","Sorry \u2014 I did not know it was a secret.",B.aQ)
B.acL=new A.bu("Once in a blue moon","Very rarely.","Not about the moon being blue.","So it almost never happens. Good to know.",B.aQ)
B.ac6=new A.bu("Speak of the devil","We were just talking about you and now you have arrived.","Friendly surprise, not an insult.","Ha \u2014 what did I miss?",B.aQ)
B.acl=new A.bu("Cut to the chase / Long story short","Skip the detail and tell me the main point.","They are short on time, not annoyed with you.","Here is the short version.",B.aQ)
B.acB=new A.bu("On the same page","We agree, or we understand the situation the same way.","Often a check for shared understanding. Saying you are not sure is useful.","I think so \u2014 can I say it back to you to check?",B.aQ)
B.acI=new A.bu("Hit the nail on the head","You said exactly the right thing.","Praise for your answer.","Thank you \u2014 that is what I meant.",B.aQ)
B.acy=new A.bu("Off the top of my head","This is a guess; I have not checked it.","Treat the number or fact as uncertain.","Thanks. Could you check and confirm later?",B.aQ)
B.acA=new A.bu("Ring a bell","That sounds familiar.","Not about a real bell.","It sounds familiar to me too, but I cannot place it.",B.aQ)
B.act=new A.bu("Sitting on the fence","Not choosing a side yet.","They may want more information before deciding.","That is fair. What would help you decide?",B.aQ)
B.acT=new A.bu("Blow off steam / Let off steam","Release stress or anger in a safe way.","Healthy if it harms nobody, including you.","That sounds like a good plan. I will do the same.",B.aQ)
B.acj=new A.bu("Bite off more than you can chew","Take on more work than you can manage.","Usually said kindly, as a warning.","You may be right. Which part should I drop?",B.aQ)
B.acR=new A.bu("In the same boat","We are in the same difficult situation.","Shared experience, not a real boat.","Good to know I am not the only one.",B.aQ)
B.ac3=new A.bu("Get cold feet / Have cold feet","Suddenly feel too nervous to do the planned thing.","Very common before big events. Not a moral failing.","That is okay. What would make it feel more manageable?",B.aQ)
B.acE=new A.bu("Give someone the cold shoulder","Deliberately ignore or be unfriendly to someone.","This one hurts. If it keeps happening, naming it out loud is allowed.","Have I done something? I would rather talk than guess.",B.aQ)
B.ac2=new A.bu("See eye to eye","Agree with each other.","Not about looking at each other.","We agree on that part, then.",B.aQ)
B.ace=new A.bu("Break the ice","Say something to make a first meeting less awkward.","Doing nothing is also acceptable. You are not required to perform.","Hi \u2014 I am not great at small talk, but I am glad to be here.",B.aQ)
B.acF=new A.bu("Burn the midnight oil","Work late into the night.","Often said as admiration or as a warning about rest.","I am trying to stop earlier \u2014 sleep matters for me.",B.aQ)
B.acq=new A.bu("Call it a day","Stop working for today.","Usually a calm, agreed ending.","Agreed \u2014 let us pick it up tomorrow.",B.aQ)
B.acU=new A.bu("Keep an eye on / Keep a close eye on","Watch it carefully for a while.","Not literal eyes.","I will watch it and tell you if something changes.",B.aQ)
B.acD=new A.bu("Hang in there / Hang on","Keep going; this hard part will pass.","Encouragement, not an instruction to endure harm.","Thank you. I will take it one step at a time.",B.aQ)
B.acr=new A.bu("Take it with a grain of salt","Do not fully believe it; treat it as uncertain.","A warning about unreliable information.","Understood \u2014 I will check another source.",B.aQ)
B.ac5=new A.bu("The last straw","The final small problem that makes a big reaction happen.","Usually about someone who was already at their limit. The reaction is not only about the small thing.","It sounds like a lot has built up. Do you want to talk about it?",B.aQ)
B.ad_=new A.bu("Water under the bridge","It is in the past; it no longer matters.","Said to close an old disagreement.","Thank you. I am glad we can leave it behind.",B.aQ)
B.acN=new A.bu("Throw in the towel","Give up on something.","Not about real towels. Stopping something that is not working is allowed.","That is a reasonable choice. What would you like to do instead?",B.aQ)
B.acv=new A.bu("Face the music","Accept the unpleasant result of something you did.","Usually about consequences, not real music.","I will deal with it. Can you tell me exactly what is expected?",B.aQ)
B.acY=new A.bu("Pull someone's leg / Pulling my leg","Joke with someone by saying something untrue.",'If you cannot tell whether it is a joke, asking "are you serious?" is completely fine.',"Are you joking? I cannot always tell.",B.aQ)
B.ad0=new A.bu("Take a rain check","Say no for now, but maybe yes another time.","A soft no. It does not guarantee a future invitation.","Thanks for asking. Another time would work better for me.",B.aQ)
B.ac9=new A.bu("Not my cup of tea","I do not enjoy it, but that is just me.","A polite way of saying no to an activity.","That is fine \u2014 thanks for telling me honestly.",B.aQ)
B.acz=new A.bu("We will see / Let us see","Maybe \u2014 but probably no. They do not want to refuse you directly.","Uncomfortable for people who need a clear answer. Asking once more for a yes or no is reasonable.","I would find it easier with a clear yes or no, either way is okay.",B.cR)
B.acQ=new A.bu("I will let you know",'Often a polite no, or a real "I do not know yet".',"It is not a promise. If you need to plan, say by when you need an answer.","Could you let me know by Friday? I need to plan around it.",B.cR)
B.acK=new A.bu("It is up to you / Whatever you prefer","They may still have a preference they are not saying.","Offering your own choice is allowed here.","I would like option A. Does that work for you?",B.cR)
B.ach=new A.bu("If you want to / Only if you want","Usually a real request, softened so it feels less like an order.","Check whether it is a request or a genuine option before saying no.","Is this a request or just an option? I want to get it right.",B.cR)
B.ac8=new A.bu("Interesting / That is interesting","Could be real interest \u2014 or polite doubt.","The tone of voice and what follows usually tells you which.","Do you mean you like it, or that you are not sure?",B.cR)
B.acW=new A.bu("No worries / It is fine / It is okay","Usually genuine, but sometimes hides annoyance that will show up later.","If the same problem happens again and they get suddenly upset, that is why. Checking once is fair.","Thank you. Please tell me if it is actually not fine.",B.cR)
B.acw=new A.bu("Sorry to bother you / Quick question","They still need an answer; the apology is only politeness.","You are allowed to say when you cannot answer right now.","It is not a bother. I can help in ten minutes.",B.cR)
B.acS=new A.bu("Can I pick your brain? / Pick your brain about","They want your knowledge or opinion on something.","Usually a short conversation, not a long project.","Sure. What do you need to know?",B.cR)
B.acZ=new A.bu("Just a heads-up","Advance warning, so you are not surprised later.","Not always an action for you. Ask if you are unsure.","Thanks for telling me. Is there anything you need me to do?",B.cR)
B.aca=new A.bu("Touch base / Sync up / Check in","Have a short update conversation.","Usually brief and planned. Ask how long it will take.","Sure \u2014 how long do you expect it to take?",B.cR)
B.acn=new A.bu("Low-hanging fruit / Quick wins","The easiest tasks, done first.","Work language. Often used to reduce a big pile of work.","So we do the easiest ones first? That works for me.",B.cR)
B.acb=new A.bu("Move the needle / Make an impact","Make a real, measurable difference.",'Work praise or a goal. Ask what "difference" means in numbers.',"What would count as a real difference here?",B.cR)
B.ac7=new A.bu("Bandwidth / I do not have the bandwidth","How much time and energy someone has available.","Nothing to do with internet speed. A soft way of saying they are overloaded.","Understood. When would you have space for this?",B.cR)
B.acV=new A.bu("At the end of the day","When everything is considered \u2014 the main point is\u2026","Introduces the final conclusion.","So the main point is what you just said. Got it.",B.cR)
B.acH=new A.bu("Friendly reminder / Gentle reminder","A reminder that may not feel friendly if it is the second or third one.","Often a request that is now overdue. A reply is usually expected.","Thanks for the reminder \u2014 I will send it today.",B.cR)
B.w1=s([B.acc,B.acd,B.acM,B.acO,B.acC,B.acs,B.aci,B.acf,B.ac4,B.acp,B.acG,B.acP,B.acX,B.acu,B.acg,B.acx,B.acm,B.aco,B.acJ,B.ack,B.acL,B.ac6,B.acl,B.acB,B.acI,B.acy,B.acA,B.act,B.acT,B.acj,B.acR,B.ac3,B.acE,B.ac2,B.ace,B.acF,B.acq,B.acU,B.acD,B.acr,B.ac5,B.ad_,B.acN,B.acv,B.acY,B.ad0,B.ac9,B.acz,B.acQ,B.acK,B.ach,B.ac8,B.acW,B.acw,B.acS,B.acZ,B.aca,B.acn,B.acb,B.ac7,B.acV,B.acH],t.CS)
